sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent<br/>(Claude Desktop/Code)
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS Edge
    participant OIDC as OIDC Auth Middleware
    participant MCP as rhoai-mcp Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAuth as K8s TokenReview /<br/>SubjectAccessReview
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant ModelReg as Model Registry<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Planner as Planner Service<br/>8000/TCP HTTP

    Note over Agent,Planner: Flow 1: Standard Mode (OIDC disabled)
    Agent->>MCP: MCP tool call (SSE/streamable-http/stdio)<br/>No auth required
    MCP->>K8sAPI: REST API call<br/>Bearer Token (ServiceAccount)
    K8sAPI-->>MCP: K8s resource response
    MCP-->>Agent: MCP tool result

    Note over Agent,Planner: Flow 2: OIDC Multi-User Mode
    Agent->>Route: MCP tool call<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer Token (OIDC JWT / OCP token)
    Route->>MCP: Forward (TLS terminated)
    MCP->>OIDC: Authenticate request
    OIDC->>K8sAuth: TokenReview (validate token)<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    K8sAuth-->>OIDC: User identity + groups
    OIDC-->>MCP: Authenticated user context

    MCP->>K8sAuth: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(check tool permissions)
    K8sAuth-->>MCP: Allowed/Denied per tool

    MCP->>K8sAPI: REST API call<br/>SA token + Impersonate-User/Group headers
    K8sAPI-->>MCP: K8s resource response
    MCP-->>Route: MCP tool result
    Route-->>Agent: HTTPS response

    Note over Agent,Planner: Flow 3: Model Registry Interaction
    Agent->>MCP: list_registered_models / get_model_benchmarks
    MCP->>ModelReg: GET /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/...<br/>HTTP/8080 (in-cluster) or HTTPS/443 (route)
    ModelReg-->>MCP: Model data (JSON)
    MCP-->>Agent: Formatted model list

    Note over Agent,Planner: Flow 4: Planner Recommendation
    Agent->>MCP: recommend_model / get_deployment_config
    MCP->>Planner: POST /api/v1/recommend<br/>HTTP/8000 (in-cluster)
    Planner-->>MCP: Ranked recommendations
    MCP-->>Agent: Deployment config + recommendations
